I am on my everyday bus.
The bus stops at a big junction.
I get down from the bus.
This place is very busy.
There are many people and vehicles here.
I do not see the other bus stop.
I see a fruit vendor nearby.
I go towards his cart.
I ask, "Brother, excuse me."
The fruit vendor says, "Yes madam, tell me."
I ask, "Where is the bus stop heading towards the south?"
He points with his hand.
"You go straight from here," he says.
"Then turn left towards the big intersection."
"The bus stop is right there."
I smile and say, "Thank you, brother."
I walk on the path he showed.
I go straight and turn left.
I see the new bus stop ahead.
